 remembers all the good times  he had in life the first face that comes  to his mind is his best friend mario who  he betrayed just some hours ago a  flashback of the days shows us that  fujimoto and morio were approached by a  reality show producer fujimoto was asked  to sign a deal with the company that  would kickstart his career but to join  the show he had to ditch his best friend  he signed the papers without thinking  about it but now that his death is near  he would rather have his friend than  participate in the stupid show the next  day tsubasa goes to an expensive  restaurant and enjoys a special feast  using his ikigami following the meal he  goes to mario and apologizes for what he  did mario's anger hasn't worn off yet  plus tsubasa didn't bring him for that  dope meal hence he refuses to listen  with nowhere else to be tsubasa goes to  the studio to take part in the show and  make a statement for the last time he is  paired up with a new guy who he is  supposed to sing with elsewhere mario  talks to subasa's mother and finds out  about the ikigami regretting not talking  to his friend for the last time he  quickly turns on the tv to watch him on  the show the performance starts and  subasa ignores the director's  instructions resorting to singing solo  rather than with the new partner knowing  that this is the last time he will sing  tsubasa pours his heart and soul into  the performance making people feel his  music he manages to accumulate his past  present and future into a single song  and dies right after the performance his  mother breaks down crying alongside  morio fujimoto who is also watching the  show is left in tears the incident goes  viral on the internet and shocks many  people a politician named kazuko takes  advantage of the death and uses it to  promote her campaign for an upcoming  election this is the most realistic part  of the story so far meanwhile fujimoto  is handed the file of his second client  named naoki he goes to the per