 to  help them on his way back to the office  he notices naoki at the train station  looking at how he hides his hand he  seems to be carrying a gun to stop him  from causing more damage fujimoto  follows him and ends up in an election  program where kazuko is delivering the  last campaign speech kazuko notices her  son among the crowd and like the  self-centered idiot that she is assumes  that he has come to support her she asks  the people to make way for him giving  him a perfect line of shot fujimoto  tries his best to stop the guy but the  crowd doesn't allow it suddenly naoki  fires at his mother but misses the shot  chaos ensues as everyone starts running  for their lives naoki has the chance to  shoot her again but right then he  remembers the time she tried to stop him  from getting the chip embedded when he  was 10 she was vocally against the  national prosperity law until she became  a politician herself naoki finally  lowers his gun but is shot by a  policeman at that very moment his father  runs to catch him and witnesses his  death while holding him close fujimoto  observes everything from afar and is  overwhelmed with many emotions he has  seen so much sadness in this job that he  has to help sakura to redeem himself he  runs back to satoshi and suggests they  change the time on every watch in the  hospital to an hour early that way when  the clock hits nine sakura will think it  is 10 and allow for the operation they  talk to all the hospital staff and  patients and everyone agrees to help  fujimoto works the entire night to  create flyers explaining the situation  then they distribute it to everyone in  the hospital just to ensure sakura won't  find out about the plan in any way  because handing out a bunch of physical  evidence is super subtle the morning  comes and sakura is told the wrong time  she gets suspicious and starts asking  strangers if her brother is telling the  truth everyone having already read the  flyer takes satoshi's side eventually  sakura is happily taken for surgery at 9  30 am she thinks she will return to see  her brother's face only when she is out  of sight does satoshi break into tears  everyone who watches him mourn cannot  help but tear up in the following scene  the higher officials from fujimoto's  office are in a re-evaluation meeting by  helping satoshi in his personal matters  he has breached the employment contract  as a result his one year's worth of  salary and bonus is deducted and he is  sent to be trained again later fujimoto  is alone in a room with his immediate  boss he loses patience and claims that  the prosperity law is nothing but  [ __ ] before he can further express  his hate the boss stops him because  they're being watched he asks fujimoto  to keep quiet until it is the right time  to talk revealing that he is also  against the law soon the people will  speak they will protest and the  government will pay for killing  thousands of innocent citizens in the  last scene we see mario returning to  sing in the street in the memory of his  friend kazuko has lost the election but  her husband's spirit is as good as new  he plans to run in the election next  year and remove the prosperity law one  way or another sakura has also gone  through a successful surgery and has  regained her vision she is thankful for  her brother's sacrifice despite being  heartbroken about his death she visits  the house he bought for them and finds a  mirror as a gift from satoshi a note  behind it says that she is the most  beautiful girl in the world  subscribe for more videos like this turn  on notifications and leave a like to  help the channel out thank you for  watching

